# Normalize line endings. This repo is authored on Windows but built on Linux
# GitHub Actions runners — see CLAUDE.md constraint 8 (all builds happen in CI).
#
# `gradlew` is the load-bearing case: if Git checks it out with CRLF on the
# runner, the shebang becomes `#!/usr/bin/env sh\r` and CI fails with
# "bad interpreter: sh^M: no such file or directory". Forcing LF here is what
# prevents that.
* text=auto eol=lf

gradlew         text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
gradlew.bat     text eol=crlf

# Binary — never touch line endings or diff as text.
*.jar           binary
*.png           binary
*.webp          binary
*.jpg           binary
*.keystore      binary
*.jks           binary
*.apk           binary
*.aab           binary
